<title>LATVIA: NEW UNIBANKA BROKER PERMIT, UDENSTILTI REGISTERED.</title>
<headline>NEW UNIBANKA BROKER PERMIT, UDENSTILTI REGISTERED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities commission on Monday said that it agreed to renew the broking licence of Unibanka for a further year to July 1998 and to offer licences to ICI-Invest and RSB Trasts un Investicijas for six months to January.</p>
<p>The commission also said in a statement that at a meeting on July 7 it had registered the issue of 647,000 shares at a nominal one lat by Latvijas udenstilti and 370,260 shares at one lat by printing firm Poligrafists.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
